1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,850
Playwright Studio. Turn your test flows into real evidence.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:09,850
Start with your application URL. Open a project, or choose Try demo.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:15,850
Select a role. Save its credentials with Edit, then choose that profile.

4
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:24,850
Write each action in order. Log in, click, fill, select, and check. Verify text and API results.

5
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:32,850
Open Advanced settings. Choose a fresh or saved session. Set a success marker, or inspect a manual session.

6
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,850
Choose your languages and frameworks. Include a test plan, and set the output folder.

7
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:46,850
Click Run test. The browser follows your steps, creates the task, and verifies the response. This is real footage.

8
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:52,850
Review every step. Failures stop dependent actions, so the results reflect what actually happened.

9
00:00:53,200 --> 00:01:00,850
Open the full report. Filter results and expand a case. Advisory plans are clearly marked as not run.

10
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:08,850
Inspect screenshots and video. Review API responses, or download the trace. Evidence stays with each report.

11
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:15,850
Review the test plan and generated files. Reopen for another run, or execute the exported suites.

12
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:23,850
Hmm. A login loop? Check redirects and responses. Stop once, and skip dependent steps.

13
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:27,850
Playwright Studio. Ready for your next test.
